# Presence of this file switches the reactor-root aggregate from embedding every module's
# full guardrail body to linking each module to its own guardrail files.
#
# Without it, CLAUDE.md at the reactor root and async-test-lib/CLAUDE.md carry a
# byte-identical 127-line <project_guardrails> block, and editing anything inside the
# module loads the same index twice. With it, the root block collapses to one pointer
# per module and the module files stay authoritative.
#
# Read by vibetags: ModuleSidecar.applyRootIndexMode(). Content is not parsed — only the
# file's presence matters.
